flowchart TD
    SRC["refined source 94 HWP + 4 PDF"]:::gray --> PARSE["pinned local canonical parsers<br/>text/table identities unchanged"]:::green
    PARSE --> HREC["HWP resource key + full layer tree<br/>exact table/cell anchor"]:::amber
    PARSE --> PREC["PDF resource bytes/path + placement<br/>raster/vector/table-child classification"]:::amber
    HREC --> OCC["VisualOccurrenceV2<br/>doc + page + bbox + container path"]:::green
    PREC --> OCC
    OCC --> LINK{"exact object link available?"}:::gray
    LINK -->|"document-local key or exact bytes/pixels+bbox"| EXACT["exact source-object provenance"]:::green
    LINK -->|"no or ambiguous"| REGION["render-region evidence<br/>source link withheld"]:::amber
    EXACT --> CROP["deterministic page-region crop<br/>crop SHA + render profile"]:::green
    REGION --> CROP
    CROP --> OCR["local Korean OCR + layout<br/>polygon/confidence/order/cells"]:::amber
    OCR --> DIAG{"relation-heavy diagram?"}:::gray
    DIAG -->|"no"| CHUNK["image-ocr/layout chunks"]:::green
    DIAG -->|"yes, pinned local model"| CAP["caption claims + support refs<br/>descriptive evidence only"]:::amber
    CAP --> CHUNK
    CHUNK --> RET["low-weight visual retrieval + RRF<br/>page/bbox/crop citation"]:::green
    RET --> GATE["5-risk HWP + 4-PDF representative execution<br/>human occurrence/title/relation gold"]:::amber
    GATE --> READY{"reviewed gold + pinned model<br/>quality gate passed?"}:::gray
    READY -->|"yes"| ROLL["94-HWP resumable rollout<br/>reconciliation + deterministic reuse"]:::green
    READY -->|"no"| BLOCK["private rollout and activation withheld"]:::red
    SRC -. "external parser/search API forbidden" .-> BLOCK

